  "description": {
    "raw": "With a single touch, you create temporary hairline fractures in a piece of stone or a creature with the earth subtype. If you cast this spell on a section of stone, you reduce its hardness to 5 and its hit points to 10/inch of thickness. If you cast this spell on a creature with the earth subtype, that creature takes a –2 penalty to AC for the spell’s duration. Make whole reverses this spell’s effect.",
    "search_text": "\"with a single touch, you create temporary hairline fractures in a piece of stone or a creature with the earth subtype. if you cast this spell on a section of stone, you reduce its hardness to 5 and its hit points to 10/inch of thickness. if you cast this spell on a creature with the earth subtype, that creature takes a –2 penalty to ac for the spell’s duration. make whole reverses this spell’s effect.\"",
